{"sourceUrl":"http://www.glycoeng.sdu.edu.cn/info/1035/3886.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:01.777041+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.glycoeng.sdu.edu.cn/info/1035/3886.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>  根据《山东大学</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生和本科直博生预报名通知》文件要求，结合实际，制定国家糖工程技术研究中心（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>糖中心</span><span>”</span><span>）</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年推免硕士研究生接收办法及复试工作安排，具体如下：</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span><span><span></span><span>学校通知链接</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>https://www.yz.sdu.edu.cn/info/1022/1225.htm</span><span>山东大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生和本科直博生预报名通知</span></span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><strong><span>接收推免生专业及人数</span></strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/f4d18e97c7416f0d1fc7.png\"/></p>\n<p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、接收条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>申请推免考生须符合以下基本条件：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. </span><span>普通全日制应届本科毕业生，在就读本科学校取得推荐免试资格，并有意报考糖中心的；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>遵纪守法，品行优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. <span>学风端正，无任何考试作弊或剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4. <span>符合我校当年招生简章和招生专业目录规定的报考条件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5. <span>身心健康，符合国家及我校的相关体检要求</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、报名网址</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>考生登录山东大学研究生招生信息网，通过推免预报名系统进行推免申请</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>报名时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span><span>0</span></span><span>9</span><span>：</span><span>0</span><span>0—9<span>月</span></span><span>14</span><span>日</span><span>14</span><span>:00</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、审查材料</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核表；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>本科阶段成绩单，须加盖学校教务主管部门公章；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>获奖证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span><span>体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.</span><span>在校期间参军入伍服兵役、参加志愿服务、到国际组织实习等证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7.</span><span>回避情况说明。凡有直系亲属或利益相关人员在我校工作，尤其是在所申请推免的招生单位工作的，要主动说明报备。对未按规定报备声明回避关系且影响推免过程和结果公平公正的学生，学校将取消其推免资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>8.</span></strong><span>招生考试诚信承诺书。</span></p>\n<p><span>考生须对所提交材料的真实性负责。对提交虚假材料或弄虚作假者，无论何时，一经发现，即取消录取资格或学籍，并按教育部相关规定严肃处理。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>六</span></strong><strong><span>、招录程序</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. 9月14日14:00前申请考生将审查材料按照系统要求上传。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. <span>收到复试通知的考生请于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日</span><span>12:00</span><span>前在预推免报名系统点击</span><span>“</span><span>确认参加复试</span><span>”</span><span>或</span><span>“</span><span>确认不参加复试</span><span>”</span></span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. <span>报到时间</span><span>:2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>7</span><span> <span>日</span></span><span>12</span><span>:00-1</span><span>6</span><span>:00</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>4. 9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日考试。</span></span><span>考试结束后，在中心网站公示拟录取名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span><span>. </span><span>录取时</span><span>，相关考生登录中国研究生招生信息网，及时填报信息，中心会通过国家推免系统以短信形式向考生发送复试通知和拟录取通知，完成推免生拟录取程序。考生应在规定时间内通过系统接收通知完成拟录取程序，逾期不接收者，取消拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>七</span></strong><strong><span>、复试具体安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>本次推免复试线下进行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>材料审核通过并收到复试通知</span></span><span><span>的同学请扫描下面的二维码，加入国家糖工程技术研究中心</span><span>2026</span></span><span>年推免考试</span><span><span>群，并修改在本群的昵称为：姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校</span><span>+</span><span>报考专业。后续通知将在群里发布。</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/a79b329a392347379dfc.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><span>3. <span>复试时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>八</span></strong><strong><span>、复试方案：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>复试内容：对考生的外语听力与口语、基础知识、实验技能知识、综合素质、科研潜力等进行综合考查。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. <span>复试报到</span></span><span>时间、</span><span>地</span><span>点</span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>报到时间</span>:2025<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>7</span><span> <span>日</span></span><span>12</span><span>:00-1</span><span>6</span><span>:00</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>山东省青岛市即墨区滨海路</span><span>72</span><span>号山东大学（青岛）淦昌苑</span><span>F</span><span>座（</span><span>K6</span><span>楼）</span><span>237</span><span>办公室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. <span>复试时间</span></span><span>及复试成绩：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>复试时间：</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span><span>日（具体时间</span><span>qq</span><span>群内公布）</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试成绩</span>=<span>面试成绩</span><span>×95%+</span><span>外语听力及口语测试成绩</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span> <span>录取办法：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>按</span><span>报名</span><span>一级学科成绩排序</span><span>，</span><span>由高到低录取</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>九</span></strong><strong><span>、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>．对在推免过程中弄虚作假，有论文（文章）抄袭、虚报获奖或科研成果等学术不端行为的学生，一经查实，即由所在高校取消推免生资格，并报省级教育招生考试机构按规定记入《国家教育考试考生诚信档案》，视情节暂停参加全国硕士研究生招生考试</span><span>1</span><span>至</span><span>3</span><span>年，并按学生管理规定严肃处理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>．已被我校接收的推免生，不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生考试招生，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>．已经取得录取资格的推免生，在研究生入学前未取得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书的，取消录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4<span>．本简章未尽事宜均以国家和山东大学相关文件为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> 联系人：毕老师</span></span>             <span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0532-58631429</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    QQ</span><span>号：</span><span>971264280                  </span></span> <span><span>邮箱：</span><span>bhp@sdu.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>  <span>国家糖工程技术研究中心</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"b35478ce5095c28c282bcc91eab1c5c47f44a5f24626b96f6de14ac56838f711","textLength":1661,"sourceSha256":"424002311435b349f0a7ffb9822791453b73f0abfa6a765edbbc1d9aa866f060","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"山东大学硕士研究生招生考试诚信复试承诺书.pdf","url":"http://www.glycoeng.sdu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1769175220&wbfileid=16497980"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5a066d615241560a593a","title":"2025年山东大学国家糖工程技术研究中心2026年接收推荐免试研究生工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:01.777041+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.glycoeng.sdu.edu.cn/__local/A/C0/26/931EE3FB47DD2C191A05AD87ADC_90752577_2F39.png","file":"assets/articles/media/f4d18e97c7416f0d1fc7.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.glycoeng.sdu.edu.cn/__local/8/CE/3E/663D0654DE078AE837BA1F688B5_94B72C8D_15ADA.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/a79b329a392347379dfc.jpg"}]}
